{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"docker-compose-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Docker Compose Snippets","description":"Services, databases, caches, proxies, health checks and volumes for Compose files.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"YAML","path":"snippets/yaml.json"},{"language":"Config","path":"snippets/config.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/yaml.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Service\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcs\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:app}:\",\n      \"  image: ${2:nginx:alpine}\",\n      \"  ports:\",\n      \"    - \\\"${3:8080}:80\\\"\",\n      \"  restart: unless-stopped\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A service\"\n  },\n  \"Service with build\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcb\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:app}:\",\n      \"  build:\",\n      \"    context: ${2:.}\",\n      \"    dockerfile: ${3:Dockerfile}\",\n      \"  ports:\",\n      \"    - \\\"${4:3000}:3000\\\"\",\n      \"  env_file: .env\",\n      \"  depends_on:\",\n      \"    - ${5:db}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A service built from a Dockerfile\"\n  },\n  \"Postgres\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcpg\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"db:\",\n      \"  image: postgres:16\",\n      \"  environment:\",\n      \"    POSTGRES_USER: ${1:app}\",\n      \"    POSTGRES_PASSWORD: ${2:secret}\",\n      \"    POSTGRES_DB: ${3:app}\",\n      \"  volumes:\",\n      \"    - dbdata:/var/lib/postgresql/data\",\n      \"  healthcheck:\",\n      \"    test: [\\\"CMD-SHELL\\\", \\\"pg_isready -U ${1:app}\\\"]\",\n      \"    interval: 5s\",\n      \"    retries: 10\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Postgres database\"\n  },\n  \"MySQL\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcmy\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"db:\",\n      \"  image: mysql:8\",\n      \"  environment:\",\n      \"    MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: ${1:secret}\",\n      \"    MYSQL_DATABASE: ${2:app}\",\n      \"  volumes:\",\n      \"    - dbdata:/var/lib/mysql\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A MySQL database\"\n  },\n  \"Redis\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcredis\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"redis:\",\n      \"  image: redis:7-alpine\",\n      \"  restart: unless-stopped\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Redis cache\"\n  },\n  \"Nginx proxy\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcnginx\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"proxy:\",\n      \"  image: nginx:alpine\",\n      \"  ports:\",\n      \"    - \\\"80:80\\\"\",\n      \"  volumes:\",\n      \"    - ./nginx.conf:/etc/nginx/nginx.conf:ro\",\n      \"  depends_on:\",\n      \"    - ${1:app}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An Nginx reverse proxy\"\n  },\n  \"Volumes\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcvol\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"volumes:\",\n      \"  ${1:dbdata}:\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A volumes section\"\n  },\n  \"Healthcheck\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dchealth\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"healthcheck:\",\n      \"  test: [\\\"CMD\\\", \\\"curl\\\", \\\"-f\\\", \\\"${1:http://localhost/}\\\"]\",\n      \"  interval: 30s\",\n      \"  timeout: 5s\",\n      \"  retries: 3\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A health check\"\n  }\n}\n"},"snippets/config.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Service\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcs\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:app}:\",\n      \"  image: ${2:nginx:alpine}\",\n      \"  ports:\",\n      \"    - \\\"${3:8080}:80\\\"\",\n      \"  restart: unless-stopped\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A service\"\n  },\n  \"Service with build\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcb\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:app}:\",\n      \"  build:\",\n      \"    context: ${2:.}\",\n      \"    dockerfile: ${3:Dockerfile}\",\n      \"  ports:\",\n      \"    - \\\"${4:3000}:3000\\\"\",\n      \"  env_file: .env\",\n      \"  depends_on:\",\n      \"    - ${5:db}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A service built from a Dockerfile\"\n  },\n  \"Postgres\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcpg\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"db:\",\n      \"  image: postgres:16\",\n      \"  environment:\",\n      \"    POSTGRES_USER: ${1:app}\",\n      \"    POSTGRES_PASSWORD: ${2:secret}\",\n      \"    POSTGRES_DB: ${3:app}\",\n      \"  volumes:\",\n      \"    - dbdata:/var/lib/postgresql/data\",\n      \"  healthcheck:\",\n      \"    test: [\\\"CMD-SHELL\\\", \\\"pg_isready -U ${1:app}\\\"]\",\n      \"    interval: 5s\",\n      \"    retries: 10\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Postgres database\"\n  },\n  \"MySQL\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcmy\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"db:\",\n      \"  image: mysql:8\",\n      \"  environment:\",\n      \"    MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: ${1:secret}\",\n      \"    MYSQL_DATABASE: ${2:app}\",\n      \"  volumes:\",\n      \"    - dbdata:/var/lib/mysql\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A MySQL database\"\n  },\n  \"Redis\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcredis\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"redis:\",\n      \"  image: redis:7-alpine\",\n      \"  restart: unless-stopped\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Redis cache\"\n  },\n  \"Nginx proxy\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcnginx\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"proxy:\",\n      \"  image: nginx:alpine\",\n      \"  ports:\",\n      \"    - \\\"80:80\\\"\",\n      \"  volumes:\",\n      \"    - ./nginx.conf:/etc/nginx/nginx.conf:ro\",\n      \"  depends_on:\",\n      \"    - ${1:app}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An Nginx reverse proxy\"\n  },\n  \"Volumes\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcvol\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"volumes:\",\n      \"  ${1:dbdata}:\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A volumes section\"\n  },\n  \"Healthcheck\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dchealth\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"healthcheck:\",\n      \"  test: [\\\"CMD\\\", \\\"curl\\\", \\\"-f\\\", \\\"${1:http://localhost/}\\\"]\",\n      \"  interval: 30s\",\n      \"  timeout: 5s\",\n      \"  retries: 3\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A health check\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Docker Compose Snippets\n\nServices, databases, caches, proxies, health checks and volumes for Compose files.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 16 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| YAML | `dcs` | A service |\n| YAML | `dcb` | A service built from a Dockerfile |\n| YAML | `dcpg` | A Postgres database |\n| YAML | `dcmy` | A MySQL database |\n| YAML | `dcredis` | A Redis cache |\n| YAML | `dcnginx` | An Nginx reverse proxy |\n| YAML | `dcvol` | A volumes section |\n| YAML | `dchealth` | A health check |\n| Config | `dcs` | A service |\n| Config | `dcb` | A service built from a Dockerfile |\n| Config | `dcpg` | A Postgres database |\n| Config | `dcmy` | A MySQL database |\n| Config | `dcredis` | A Redis cache |\n| Config | `dcnginx` | An Nginx reverse proxy |\n| Config | `dcvol` | A volumes section |\n| Config | `dchealth` | A health check |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}